- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-1ic1phd3/src/lint/output/sarif.rs` - Pattern to follow for the `GhaFormatter` (same trait, same test structure)
- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-1ic1phd3/src/main.rs` - Entry point where GHA detection and UI construction must be wired together
- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-1ic1phd3/src/cli/commands/lint.rs` - Lint command where `--format gha` must be added to the format dispatch

